        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Rianramei guai nai dat lakkhe,",
            "Bumang kandih gaipui ram khou;",
            "Kanloumei guai bam pui ram me,",
            "Aniu kandih hei kum mak ge.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Rianramei lung geimei rui gumliam,",
            "Rianramei rui dui kumma dailiam;",
            "Neila na suanni lu karu khou,",
            "Gaina hei ram 6$% guangtang pukhou.",
            "",
            "2. Hei kandih hei mu kum makge,",
            "Rianra khanga kap pui ram e;",
            "Kanpat lou o bam cham dikho,",
            "Neilamei guai akhang suni.",
            "",
            "3. Kandih khou hei tam kanmei guai,",
            "Ata kau e duipang ram khou;",
            "Gaipui ram khou guangtang khap tho,",
            "Kaniu ban 6$% hamna kao e.",
            "",
            "4. He nthuk ge poubaumei jeih,",
            "Rianramei guai nangpan khou rui;",
            "Gaipui ram 6$% guangtang nu the,",
            "Kandih rianra ram patlouna."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
